# Served web (PC localhost AND phone PWA): leave EMPTY so the app uses SAME-ORIGIN
# -- it fetches from whatever host served it (localhost OR the LAN IP). Baking an
# absolute IP here breaks localhost access and dies whenever the IP changes.
#
# The Capacitor APK loads from file:// and CANNOT use same-origin, so build the
# APK with the LAN IP passed explicitly, e.g. (PowerShell):
#   $env:VITE_API_BASE='http://10.100.102.123:8800'; npm run build; npx cap copy android
VITE_API_BASE=
